==== stale-slot: N-2 (M = A) and N-1 (M = B) acknowledged; N stores M = C, only slot N mod 2's page fails; next stores M2 = D
# commit = commit N succeeded; latched = requiresRecovery() after it
# same-boot = the reopen: recovery; M = its value then (A, B, C, D, 0, other)
# next = next's commit() result / sequence (0: none)
# log x/b/d = buffered and O_DIRECT copies of the log chunk equal (x); slot 0,1 sequences in the buffered (b) and O_DIRECT (d) copy, - = no record
# after-drop = fault-verify-acks after umount + mount: recovery; slots found; M; M2; verdict (every acknowledged transaction present, N whole or absent)
case                         commit latched same-boot  M     next  log@commit  log@reopen  log@next    log@drop    after-drop slots  M     M2    verdict      fs
