==== tear: N-2 (M = A) and N-1 (M = B) acknowledged; N stores M = C and Z = E; the page holding both slots fails
# commit = commit N succeeded; latched = requiresRecovery() after it
# same-boot = the reopen: recovery; M and Z then (A, B, C, E, 0, other)
# log x/b/d = buffered and O_DIRECT copies of the log chunk equal (x); slot 0,1 sequences in the buffered (b) and O_DIRECT (d) copy, - = no record
# after-drop = fault-verify-acks after umount + mount: recovery; slots found; M; Z; verdict (N-1 present, N whole or absent)
case                   commit latched same-boot  M     Z     log@commit  log@reopen  log@drop    after-drop slots  M     Z     verdict      fs
